  "message": "Migrate integration execution and row conversion to SQLAlchemy 2 APIs.",
  "rationale": "Wrap SQL statements with text() and convert mapping results to plain dictionaries while retaining bound parameters, ordering, and the single transaction that rolls back the batch on failure. The existing SQLAlchemy 2.0.36 dependency pin remains unchanged.",
